; WHO 4 thermoregulation: the zone setpoint write up to 0351, on the zone
; (*#4*1*#14*TTTT*MODE##) and on the zone's control-unit form (*#4*#1*#14*TTTT*MODE##).
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: the same 13 setpoint
; values with every mode 0..5 on both WHERE forms: 0000, 0001, 0029, 0030, 0049, 0050, 0051,
; 0100, 0200, 0250, 0349, 0350, 0351. The values from 0400 up are in
; thermo-setpoint-writes-high.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.

